{
  "_about": [
    "Feat loop, batch 1, lane b1-modifiers (2026-11-22): plain and situational modifiers and",
    "skill-use feats, in the grammar core.json uses (rules/classbuilder.py",
    "validate_feat_document). Benefit text from content/feats/feats.json, checked against",
    "aonprd.com FeatDisplay. New readers this lane built, each used by more than one feat:",
    "comma-separated picks on `$target` (Scholar, Prodigy, Cosmopolitan); the formula names",
    "`ranks_<skill>` and `allies` (Actor._feat_formula_extra: Stone Read, Shake It Off, Swarm",
    "Scatter); feat terms on the AC line with a roll context, `attack` and `flanked`",
    "(Actor._ac_context: Low Profile, Back to Back); `against` sleep, electricity, emotion,",
    "area and demoralize (effectspec.AGAINST). A `not_yet` names a clause the engine does not",
    "run; a feat carrying one is PARTIAL, never done."
  ],
